      "t": "はい、到着です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, we have arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ここに泊まれるの？すごい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We get to stay here? Amazing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "日本語ペラペラだけど、どこ出身？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You speak Japanese so fluently—where are you from?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "東京です。ほとんどハワイにいるから大丈夫！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tokyo. I'm in Hawaii almost all the time, so don't worry!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "やっぱ日本人じゃん！ハワイ案内できるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I knew you were Japanese! Can you really show us around Hawaii?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "もちろん！心配しすぎだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course! You worry way too much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ちゃんとキャストはそろってるんだろうな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've got the whole cast properly lined up, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "もちろんです！村西さん、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course! Mr. Muranishi, go ahead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
