      "t": "'I'm Director Muranishi. This film is a blockbuster about fighting an evil organization.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "役者の質が低くないか？大丈夫なんだろうな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Isn't the quality of the actors a bit low? Are you sure about them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "大丈夫、大丈夫。芝居は完璧ですから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's fine, totally fine. Their acting is flawless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "玄関だ。彼女かも！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's the front door. It might be her!'",
      "gap": 0.65
